01:06:29.122 --> 01:06:30.181
And so and it was like yeah,

01:06:30.181 --> 01:06:32.012
we shouldn't have put that in there.

01:06:32.012 --> 01:06:33.048
Yeah I don't wanna overstate it either.

01:06:33.048 --> 01:06:34.927
I don't wanna be like,
I'm just saying it like,

01:06:34.927 --> 01:06:37.541
what I've noticed a number
of times is I'll be like,

01:06:37.541 --> 01:06:39.102
"Things are good right now."

01:06:39.102 --> 01:06:41.716
And then all of a sudden I'm
reading something and then.

01:06:41.716 --> 01:06:42.704
I just know what the weakness is.

01:06:42.704 --> 01:06:43.696
Those things.
I'm not saying

01:06:43.696 --> 01:06:44.595
it ruins my day.

01:06:44.595 --> 01:06:45.428
I'm saying that.
Those things

01:06:45.428 --> 01:06:48.842
that you mentioned are
things that we already know.

01:06:48.842 --> 01:06:52.155
People are gonna be opinionated
about the way we look,

01:06:52.155 --> 01:06:53.362
the way that I act.

01:06:53.362 --> 01:06:54.892
Our non-chef.

01:06:54.892 --> 01:06:56.852
Like there's, yeah.

01:06:56.852 --> 01:07:00.399
There's some targets on our
back if you want to be critical.

01:07:00.399 --> 01:07:02.066
But those are things

01:07:03.546 --> 01:07:05.926
